Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:21.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 飘落吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.77,0:18:24.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:26.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:28.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:30.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:32.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:36.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！你搞什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.93,0:18:39.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,飘落地更猛一点啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:41.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:46.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:49.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:52.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:55.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈！弱爆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:57.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我强炸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:19:02.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure小妹妹们 今天你们该认命了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:05.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:09.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,该认命的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:11.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗这才开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:19.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 乱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:24.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:26.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要发愣！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:28.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,给我攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:32.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 乱暴！乱暴！乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:33.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:34.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:42.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:46.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 乱... 乱乱... 乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:48.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,眼... 眼睛...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:53.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛... 骨碌碌地... 打转
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.82,0:19:55.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,出破绽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:57.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:19:59.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:08.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.85,0:20:12.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哇... 等... 等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,重死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:18.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:21.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不会放任你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:24.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们的学校肆意妄为！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:27.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你快点给我让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
