Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:27.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 那两个人好帅的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:40.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,转校第一天... 发生了太多事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:43.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不觉就放学了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:46.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“只要结果好 过程别在意”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了！英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 小白！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起回家吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:58.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:00.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Prism哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1055,970)}棱镜愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:13.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家试着跟我一起跳舞吧！
